    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that {@link LocalDate#from(java.time.temporal.TemporalAccessor)} correctly converts a {@link PaxDate} to its ISO {@link LocalDate} equivalent. <p>The Pax calendar starts one day before the ISO epoch: Pax 0001-01-01 == ISO 0000-12-31. Leap years in Pax insert an extra 7-day month (month 13), shifting the normal month 13 to 14."
